Keyboard space: runningRef.current ? pauseTimer() : startTimer(). Keep toggleRunning for keyboard wrapper using function to avoid stale secondsLeft? Keyboard effect deps start/pause.

Could keep `toggleRunning` and add buttons calling start (which calls toggle only when stopped). Simpler:
```ts
