reasoning_content.text:
Now responsive CSS + nav mobile. Add before </style>.

@media (max-width: 1020px) {
  .hero-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr; gap:3.5rem}
  .hero-copy{max-width:640px}
  .hero-art{justify-self:start; max-width:440px}
  .section-head{grid-template-columns:1fr;align-items:start}
  .section-intro{justify-self:start;padding-bottom:0}
  .hours-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:2.8rem}
  .contact-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:2.8rem}
  .menu-grid{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr))}
}
@media (max-width: 820px) {
  .header-inner{min-height:70px}
  .nav-toggle{display:flex}
  .site-nav{
    position:absolute; top:100%; left:0; right:0;
    flex-direction:column; align-items:stretch; gap:.2rem;
    background:var(--paper); border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);
    padding:1rem 24px 1.4rem; box-shadow:0 24px 40px -30px rgba(42,32,26,.5);
    transform:translateY(-8px); opacity:0; visibility:hidden; transition:...;
  }
  .site-nav.is-open{transform:none;opacity:1;visibility:visible}
  .site-nav a{padding:.75rem 0; font-size:1rem; border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}
  .site-nav a::after{display:none}
  .site-nav .nav-cta{margin-top:.9rem; border-bottom:0; justify-content:center; padding:.85rem 1.25rem}
  .chip-rating{right:0}
  .chip-roast{left:0}
  .stamp{right:0;bottom:-2%}
}
Need .site-header position sticky; nav absolute relative to header. Add .site-header{position:sticky} and .header-inner position relative? Nav absolute top:100% is relative to nearest positioned ancestor = .site-header (sticky = positioned). Its top:100% would be bottom of header including... fine since header height equals inner. Actually sticky header height = inner height, fine.

@media (max-width: 620px) {
  .wrap{padding-inline:20px}
  .hero{padding-top:2.2rem}
  .hero h1{font-size:clamp(2.45rem,9vw,3.2rem)} maybe default clamp already 2.7 min; lower to 2.5.
  .hero-actions .btn{flex:1 1 auto}
  .menu-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}
  .menu-toolbar{align-items:flex-start}
  .menu-count{order:2}
  .hours-card{padding:1.35rem}
  .hours-card-head{flex-direction:column;align-items:flex-start}
  .contact-details > div{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:.1rem}
  .footer-inner{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:1.2rem}
  .footer-copy{grid-column:auto}
  .float-chip{padding:.6rem .75rem;font-size:.72rem}
  .float-chip small{font-size:.65rem}
  .chip-rating{top:4%;right:-2%}
  .chip-roast{bottom:8%;left:-2%}
  .stamp{width:80px;height:80px;font-size:.5rem;right:-1%}
  .hero-art{max-width:360px}
  .hours-live{font-size:.7rem;align-items:flex-start}
  .menu-tags span{font-size:.6rem}
  .field input,.field textarea{font-size:16px} (prevent iOS zoom)
}

Also add scroll-margin-top for sections: section{scroll-margin-top:90px} to avoid sticky header overlap. Add `[id]{scroll-margin-top:88px}`.

Also `.hero h1 em{white-space:nowrap}` on mobile might cause overflow; headline "better neighbors." nowrap only on em word "neighbors." fine.

Add these responsive rules.

